{
  "openapi": "3.0.3",
  "info": {
    "title": "\u8001\u732b\u82f9\u679cID\u6258\u7ba1 User API",
    "description": "\u7528\u6237 API \u63a5\u53e3\uff0c\u63d0\u4f9b\u8d26\u53f7\u7ba1\u7406\u3001\u6807\u7b7e\u5206\u7c7b\u548c\u5206\u4eab\u9875\u914d\u7f6e\u529f\u80fd\u3002\n\n## \u8ba4\u8bc1\u65b9\u5f0f\n\n\u6240\u6709 API \u8bf7\u6c42\u5fc5\u987b\u5728 HTTP \u8bf7\u6c42\u5934\u4e2d\u5305\u542b `X-API-Key` \u8fdb\u884c\u8eab\u4efd\u8ba4\u8bc1\uff1a\n\n```\nX-API-Key: your_api_key_here\n```\n\nAPI Key \u53ef\u5728\u7528\u6237\u4e2d\u5fc3\u7684\u4e2a\u4eba\u4fe1\u606f\u9875\u9762\u83b7\u53d6\u6216\u91cd\u65b0\u751f\u6210\u3002\n\n## \u54cd\u5e94\u683c\u5f0f\n\n\u5927\u591a\u6570\u63a5\u53e3\u4f7f\u7528\u7edf\u4e00\u7684\u54cd\u5e94\u683c\u5f0f\uff1a\n\n```json\n{\n  \"ret\": 1,        // 1=\u6210\u529f, 0=\u5931\u8d25\n  \"msg\": \"Success\", // \u54cd\u5e94\u6d88\u606f\n  \"data\": {}       // \u54cd\u5e94\u6570\u636e\n}\n```\n\n**\u6ce8\u610f**\uff1a\u5373\u4f7f\u4e1a\u52a1\u5931\u8d25\uff0cHTTP \u72b6\u6001\u7801\u901a\u5e38\u4ecd\u4e3a 200\uff0c\u8bf7\u68c0\u67e5\u54cd\u5e94\u4e2d\u7684 `ret` \u5b57\u6bb5\u5224\u65ad\u64cd\u4f5c\u7ed3\u679c\u3002\n",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "contact": {
      "name": "API Support"
    },
    "license": {
      "name": "Proprietary"
    },
    "x-jentic-source-url": "https://api.swaggerhub.com/apis/nos-80e/laomaosuserapi/1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://aunlock.laomaos.com",
      "description": "\u751f\u4ea7\u73af\u5883"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Accounts",
      "description": "\u8d26\u53f7\u7ba1\u7406\u63a5\u53e3 - \u67e5\u8be2\u3001\u76d1\u63a7\u548c\u63a7\u5236\u8d26\u53f7"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tags",
      "description": "\u6807\u7b7e\u7ba1\u7406\u63a5\u53e3 - \u83b7\u53d6\u548c\u4f7f\u7528\u6807\u7b7e\u8fdb\u884c\u8d26\u53f7\u5206\u7c7b"
    },
    {
      "name": "SharePages",
      "description": "\u5206\u4eab\u9875\u7ba1\u7406\u63a5\u53e3 - \u521b\u5efa\u548c\u7ba1\u7406\u8d26\u53f7\u5206\u4eab\u94fe\u63a5"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "ApiKeyAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/client/getAllAccounts": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Accounts"
        ],
        "summary": "\u83b7\u53d6\u6240\u6709\u8d26\u53f7",
        "description": "\u83b7\u53d6\u5f53\u524d\u7528\u6237\u7684\u6240\u6709\u5df2\u542f\u7528\u8d26\u53f7\u5217\u8868\u3002\u8fd4\u56de\u8d26\u53f7\u7684\u57fa\u672c\u4fe1\u606f\u3001\u6700\u540e\u68c0\u67e5\u72b6\u6001\u548c\u6240\u5c5e\u5730\u533a\u3002\n\n**\u6ce8\u610f**\uff1a\u4ec5\u8fd4\u56de\u72b6\u6001\u4e3a\"\u5df2\u542f\u7528\"\u7684\u8d26\u53f7\u3002\n",
        "operationId": "getAllAccounts",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "\u6210\u529f\u8fd4\u56de\u8d26\u53f7\u5217\u8868\uff08\u6570\u7ec4\u683c\u5f0f\uff09",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Account"
                  }
                },
                "examples": {
                  "success": {
                    "summary": "\u6210\u529f\u793a\u4f8b",
                    "value": [
                      {
                        "id": 1,
                        "username": "user@example.com",
                        "password": "password123",
                        "last_check": "2025-10-19 12:00:00",
                        "last_check_success": true,
                        "region_display": "\u4e2d\u56fd"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": 2,
                        "username": "user2@example.com",
                        "password": "password456",
                        "last_check": "2025-10-19 11:30:00",
                        "last_check_success": false,
                        "region_display": "\u7f8e\u56fd"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "empty": {
                    "summary": "\u7a7a\u5217\u8868\uff08\u65e0\u5df2\u542f\u7528\u8d26\u53f7\uff09",
                    "value": []
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/UnauthorizedError"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ForbiddenError"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/client/getAccountsByTag": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Accounts"
        ],
        "summary": "\u6309\u6807\u7b7e\u83b7\u53d6\u8d26\u53f7",
        "description": "\u6839\u636e\u6807\u7b7e ID \u7b5b\u9009\u8d26\u53f7\u5217\u8868\u3002\u652f\u6301\u83b7\u53d6\u7279\u5b9a\u6807\u7b7e\u4e0b\u7684\u8d26\u53f7\u6216\u5168\u90e8\u8d26\u53f7\u3002\n\n**\u53c2\u6570\u8bf4\u660e\uff1a**\n- `tag=0`: \u83b7\u53d6\u6240\u6709\u8d26\u53f7\uff08\u5ffd\u7565\u6807\u7b7e\u7b5b\u9009\uff09\n- `tag>0`: \u83b7\u53d6\u6307\u5b9a\u6807\u7b7e\u4e0b\u7684\u6240\u6709\u8d26\u53f7\n",
        "operationId": "getAccountsByTag",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "tag",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "\u6807\u7b7e ID\uff0c0 \u8868\u793a\u83b7\u53d6\u6240\u6709\u8d26\u53f7",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0
            },
            "example": 1
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "\u6210\u529f\u8fd4\u56de\u8d26\u53f7\u5217\u8868\uff08\u6807\u51c6\u54cd\u5e94\u683c\u5f0f\uff09",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "success": {
                    "summary": "\u6210\u529f\u793a\u4f8b",
                    "value": {
                      "ret": 1,
                      "msg": "Success",
                      "data": [
                        {
                          "id": 1,
                          "username": "user@example.com",
                          "password": "password123",
                          "last_check": "2025-10-19 12:00:00",
                          "last_check_success": true,
                          "region_display": "\u4e2d\u56fd"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "noAccounts": {
                    "summary": "\u65e0\u8d26\u53f7",
                    "value": {
                      "ret": 1,
                      "msg": "No accounts found"
                    }
                  },
                  "missingParameter": {
                    "summary": "\u7f3a\u5c11\u53c2\u6570",
                    "value": {
                      "ret": 0,
                      "msg": "Missing parameter: tag"
                    }
                  },
                  "invalidParameter": {
                    "summary": "\u65e0\u6548\u53c2\u6570",
                    "value": {
                      "ret": 0,
                      "msg": "Invalid parameter: tag must be a number"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/UnauthorizedError"
          }
        }
      }
    },
